{"id":"01f033d6e32dc6b8","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NaiveModel.md","title":"NaiveModel","display":"NaiveModel","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"NaiveModel","parameters":["D","I","J"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"NaiveModel"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>D</span><span>I</span><span>J</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：对象理论模型与证明。有序参数：<code>D</code>、<code>I</code>、<code>J</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ NaiveModel D I J)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists E\n  (exists F\n    (exists R\n      (exists f\n        (exists r\n          (exists T\n            (and\n              (@ SetSig E F R f r)\n              (and\n                (@ TheoryNaive T)\n                (and\n                  (@ FModel E F R f r D I J)\n                  (forall a (implies (in a T) (forall e (implies (@ FAssign D e) (@ FSat E F R f r D I J e a))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b1aebb86096a232a\" href=\"?note=b1aebb86096a232a\" title=\"ZFC_FAssign\">FAssign</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"debeca760396db21\" href=\"?note=debeca760396db21\" title=\"ZFC_FModel\">FModel</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c284b26e0e1daa9f\" href=\"?note=c284b26e0e1daa9f\" title=\"ZFC_FSat\">FSat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b769d4b8d11e5120\" href=\"?note=b769d4b8d11e5120\" title=\"ZFC_SetSig\">SetSig</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"da8ab13a5e3cf2fe\" href=\"?note=da8ab13a5e3cf2fe\" title=\"ZFC_TheoryNaive\">TheoryNaive</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ NaiveModel D I J)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FAssign","status":"resolved","id":"b1aebb86096a232a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FAssign|FAssign]]；[[ZFC_FModel|FModel]]；[[ZFC_FSat|FSat]]；[[ZFC_SetSig|SetSig]]；[[ZFC_TheoryNaive|TheoryNaive]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FModel","status":"resolved","id":"debeca760396db21","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FAssign|FAssign]]；[[ZFC_FModel|FModel]]；[[ZFC_FSat|FSat]]；[[ZFC_SetSig|SetSig]]；[[ZFC_TheoryNaive|TheoryNaive]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FSat","status":"resolved","id":"c284b26e0e1daa9f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FAssign|FAssign]]；[[ZFC_FModel|FModel]]；[[ZFC_FSat|FSat]]；[[ZFC_SetSig|SetSig]]；[[ZFC_TheoryNaive|TheoryNaive]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_SetSig","status":"resolved","id":"b769d4b8d11e5120","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FAssign|FAssign]]；[[ZFC_FModel|FModel]]；[[ZFC_FSat|FSat]]；[[ZFC_SetSig|SetSig]]；[[ZFC_TheoryNaive|TheoryNaive]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_TheoryNaive","status":"resolved","id":"da8ab13a5e3cf2fe"